prints["Airport"]={id="Airport",title="Louisville International Airport",text="Air travel. Few words evoke as much stress - but that isn't true at Louisville International Airport! We serve over two million passengers a year, and 94%% of them report being happy with their time with us*.\n\n*from a sample of 16 people\n\nOur world class building is designed with you in mind. Ample seating means you can take a break whenever you need. Restaurants and cafes keep you fueled for your journey. Spotless bathrooms mean one less worry.\n\nWe are proud to be the airport with the LEAST cancelled and delayed flights in the United States of America! Your journey is safe with us!\n\nKnow the way before you go with our map, and make the most of your journey. And if you get lost, our happy-to-help staff will make sure you reach your destination!\n\n600 Terminal Drive, Louisville, Kentucky.",locations={{x=15347,y=2823}}}
printList[#printList+1]="Airport"
prints["AMZSteel"]={id="AMZSteel",title="AMZ Steel",text="AMZ Steel provides the highest quality metals and metal products to America.\n\nWith an annual capacity of 400,000 net tons, our Kentucky plant helps our customers innovate, solve and excel.\n\nIron runs in our blood, and AMZ Steel forges an America for the next century.\n\nAMZ Steel.\n\nTurning America into a fortress, one girder at a time...\n\nAn American Made Zinc Company.\nA Hokkaido Steel Works subsidiary.\n\n48 Steelworks Road, Ekron, Kentucky.",locations={{x=1891,y=10807}}}
