prints["QuillManor"]={id="QuillManor",title="Brenford's Quill Manor",text="Quill Manor is now open for Saturday tours!\n\nOwned by Michael Brenford, heir to the Quill pen and ink company, the classical manor was built by Mr. Brenford's father in 1953.\n\nHear the tale of Kevin Brenford, Michael's uncle, who mysteriously disappeared in the Appalachians.\n\nSee the actual room where Geoffrey Brenford planned Quill's initial public offering in 1968.\n\nWith luck, you may meet Michael Brenford himself, with his famous pet sheep Mittens!\n\nCall 943-555-QUILL to book a tour\n\n1 Brenford Avenue, Brandenburg, Kentucky",locations={{x=1307,y=7375}}}
